<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>FIX UR FACE (with Fred Durst)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">mgk, Fred Durst</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">FIX UR FACE (with Fred Durst)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0zcU626JV9kV61raS5sGu4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.070" end="00:11.220">That's right, motherfucker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.220" end="00:13.590">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.590" end="00:17.730">Bring it on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.730" end="00:20.220">Shut the fuck up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.220" end="00:22.270">Get up, get up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.270" end="00:25.190">You got that right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.190" end="00:27.800">It's time to turn this motherfucker up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.800" end="00:30.110">Ay, sometimes I need alone time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.110" end="00:33.020">But for this one time, I'm all over your ass like cum drying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.020" end="00:34.720">I heard that they don't like me, that's fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.720" end="00:37.300">'Cause we don't like y'all (and we not like y'all)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.300" end="00:40.190">I'm done trying, I tried dying enough times</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.190" end="00:42.360">Eight lives, I used all those, I'm on nine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.360" end="00:44.760">What's up here? If we all really stuck here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.760" end="00:47.340">Is there anybody else who doesn't give a fuck here? (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.340" end="00:49.310">Mickey Mouse kids turned rockstars</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.310" end="00:51.770">Leaving private schools, trying to be outlaws</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.770" end="00:54.110">And the old heads always trying to kill the vibe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.110" end="00:56.720">But rock's not dead long as I'm alive, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.720" end="00:59.440">All around the world, around the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.440" end="01:01.240">I know you feel this shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.240" end="01:03.810">I wish I had a -, wish I was a -</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.810" end="01:06.150">Wish I gave a -, but I don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.150" end="01:08.880">All around the world, around the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.880" end="01:10.530">I know you feel this shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.530" end="01:13.260">I wish I had a -, wish I was a -</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.260" end="01:15.460">Wish I gave a -, but I don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.460" end="01:17.490">Silicon Valley, silicone tits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.490" end="01:19.820">Psilocybin in milligrams in the new age fix</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.820" end="01:22.160">The only rare thing left is the New York strip</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.160" end="01:24.870">I heard they want the old me, get off my new age dick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.870" end="01:27.150">Whips with horsepower, I'm a concrete cowboy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.150" end="01:29.660">The hundred Gabapentin pen couldn't calm me down, boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.660" end="01:31.700">Even with some filler, they couldn't change my lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.700" end="01:34.870">Even with some Altoids, I'ma still talk shit (oh, shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.870" end="01:36.430">They should've never gave me money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.430" end="01:38.800">Should've kept me in the house like it's 2020</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.800" end="01:41.070">'Cause I'm back outside, ain't got nothing to do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.070" end="01:43.850">Except piss y'all off 'cause I got nothing to lose, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.850" end="01:46.520">All around the world, around the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.520" end="01:48.300">I know you feel this shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.300" end="01:50.850">I wish I had a -, wish I was a -</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.850" end="01:53.110">Wish I gave a -, but I don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.110" end="01:55.970">All around the world, around the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.970" end="01:57.710">I know you feel this shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.710" end="02:00.360">I wish I had a -, wish I was a -</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.360" end="02:03.480">Wish I gave a -, but I don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.480" end="02:04.980">Yeah, when you talk to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.900" end="02:08.480">Fix that fucking face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.480" end="02:09.980">Yeah, motherfucker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.600" end="02:17.600">Fix that fucking face, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.630" end="02:26.420">They build it up, I tear it down (they build it up, I tear it down)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.420" end="02:31.210">They build it up, I tear it down (they build it up, I tear it down)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.210" end="02:35.890">They build it up, I tear it down (they build it up, I tear it down)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.890" end="02:4